WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.205
Open the bundled conveyor example and wait until it is ready.

2
00:00:22.205 --> 00:00:44.525
Keep the failing page open. Open Diagnostics & support in Settings.

3
00:00:44.525 --> 00:01:06.734
Choose the scope and refresh the preview. Diagnostics are not uploaded automatically.

4
00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:36.908
Expand the redacted preview. Check the actual contents and snapshot time.

5
00:01:36.909 --> 00:01:58.152
Download the diagnostic ZIP. Review it and decide whether to send it to support.

6
00:01:58.152 --> 00:02:20.680
Exclude the scene summary and export again. The report marks excluded sections.
